 and shops just like an ordinary small village anywhere. A friendly guy says that it is a typical Alpine village with the glamour of Paris and the atmosphere of Venice... Is it, really?! OK. Let's take a closer look... Oh, my goodness! The village looks as if it is made of sushi tools - The banks of the canals are sushi pails. The buildings are piled-up sushi baskets etc...<br><br>\nThis series of animated shorts is full of humorous mishaps and heart-warming tales giving smiles and chuckles to everybody. They are also educational and entertaining describing friendship and kindness. So, please enjoy the mind-healing tales in this fantasy land.<br><br>\n(Source: AniDB)","duration":3,"endDate":{"day":26,"month":9,"year":2003},"episodes":130,"externalLinks":[],"genres":["Comedy","Slice of Life"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":34,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV_SHORT","rank":13,"season":null,"type":"POPULAR","year":2003},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV_SHORT","rank":3,"season":"SPRING","type":"POPULAR","year":2003}],"relations":[],"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2003,"source":null,"startDate":{"day":31,"month":3,"year":2003},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":12,"score":10},{"amount":2,"score":20},{"amount":3,"score":30},{"amount":3,"score":40},{"amount":2,"score":50},{"amount":1,"score":60},{"amount":4,"score":70},{"amount":2,"score":100}],"statusDistribution":[{"amount":7,"status":"CURRENT"},{"amount":37,"status":"PLANNING"},{"amount":54,"status":"COMPLETED"},{"amount":28,"status":"DROPPED"},{"amount":3,"status":"PAUSED"}]},"status":"FINISHED","streamingEpisodes":[],"studios":[],"synonyms":[],"title":{"english":"Kappamaki and the Sushi Kids","native":"かっぱまき","romaji":"Kappamaki"},"trailer":null,"trending":0,"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1793537761},"20125":{"al":20125,"bannerImage":null,"coverImage":{"color":"#f1ae5d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/med